on?","type":"Conference Poster","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-742618","year":"2022","yearsub":"2022"}
{"abstract":"Evolutionary understanding is central to biology. It is also an essential prerequisite to understanding and making informed decisions about societal issues such as climate change. Yet, evolution is generally poorly understood by civil society and many misconceptions exist. Citizen science, which has been increasing in popularity as a means to gather new data and promote scientific literacy, is one strategy through which people could learn about evolution. However, despite the potential for citizen science to promote evolution learning opportunities, very few projects implement them. In this paper, we make the case for incorporating evolution education into citizen science, define key learning goals, and suggest opportunities for designing and evaluating projects in order to promote scientific literacy in evolution.","author_count":14,"contributors":["Brandt, Mirjam","Groom, Quentin","Magro, Alexandra Magro","Misevic, Dusan","Narraway, Claire L.","Bruckermann, Till","Beniermann, Anna","Børsen, Tom","González, Josefa","Meeus, Sofie","Roy, Helen E.","Sá-Pinto, Xana","Torres, Jorge Roberto","Jenkins, Tania"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-076819"],"filters":{"added":"2022-09","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["America, North","Europe, EU","Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"corresponding_author":["Jenkins, Tania"],"country":["Belgium","France","Germany","Portugal","Spain","Switzerland","United Kingdom","United States"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Botanic Garden Meise","CSIC-UPF - Institute of Evolutionary Biology","Centre for Ecology and Hydrology","Earthwatch Institute","Humboldt University of Berlin","La Ciència Al Teu Món","Leibniz Institute for Science and Mathematics Education","Leibniz Institute for Zoo and Wildlife Research","Leibniz University Hannover","University of Aveiro","University of Geneva","Université Paris Cité","Université Paul Sabatier Toulouse III"],"keyword":["Citizen science","Climate change","Community Participation","Education","Evaluation","Humans","Learning","Literacy","Public participation in scientific research"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"promoting scientific literacy in evolution through citizen science","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY 4.0","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1098/rspb.2022.1077","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-076819","identifier":[{"id":"35946159","type":"pmid"},{"id":"85135729741","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-5c36d56b-e187-4ebc-a1ed-6b3009ad2b21"],"keyword":["Citizen Science","Climate Change","Community Participation","Humans","Learning","Literacy","education","evaluation","evolution misconceptions","public participation in scientific research"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-2A26AAD2A163B1F8AADBB8E7FB059EDC"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY 4.0","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/481605784/rspb.2022.1077.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY 4.0","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1098/rspb.2022.1077","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2022","yearSub":"2022"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"de","key":"leibniz institute for zoo and wildlife research","loc":["Germany","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Leibniz Institute for Zoo and Wildlife Research","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"be","key":"botanic garden meise","loc":["Belgium","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Botanic Garden Meise","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"fr","key":"université paul sabatier toulouse iii","loc":["France","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Université Paul Sabatier Toulouse III","used":1},{